sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Frontend as SvelteKit UI (apps/web)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (apps/api)
    participant Service as Dataset/Conversation Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant FS as Local File System
    participant Agent as LangGraph Data Analyst Agent
    participant DuckDB as DuckDB Engine
    participant LLM as OpenAI API

    User->>Frontend: Upload CSV/Parquet dataset
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/datasets/upload
    API->>FS: Save raw file to files/datasets/
    API->>DuckDB: Profile columns & infer schema
    API->>DB: Store metadata in PostgreSQL (datasets table)
    API-->>Frontend: Return Dataset response JSON

    User->>Frontend: Send Chat Prompt / Data Query
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/chat/stream (SSE)
    API->>Service: Create Message record in DB
    API->>Agent: Invoke DataAnalystOrchestrator.run_stream()
    
    loop Tool Call Loop
        Agent->>LLM: Send prompt & schema context
        LLM-->>Agent: Request tool execution (e.g. execute_sql / generate_chart)
        Agent->>DuckDB: Run SQL against dataset file
        DuckDB-->>Agent: Return query result dataframe / summary
        Agent->>Frontend: Stream SSE step/tool events
    end

    Agent->>LLM: Synthesize final answer & chart specs
    LLM-->>Agent: Final narrative response
    Agent->>DB: Store assistant message & artifacts
    Agent-->>API: Stream final tokens
    API-->>Frontend: Complete SSE stream
